{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## L = 2, $V_\\lambda\\otimes V_\\lambda$: scalar product, $\\kappa_2$, and the functionals $\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle$, $\\langle k_2^{u/h}Q_{12}\\rangle$\n\nContinuation of `L1-mathcalA.wb`, same conventions on each site: $T_{ij}(u)=\\sum_k\\mathcal L^{(1)}_{ik}(u-\\theta_1)\\mathcal L^{(2)}_{kj}(u-\\theta_2)$, $\\mathcal L_{ij}(u)=u\\delta_{ij}-hE_{ji}$, $G=\\mathrm{diag}(z)$ unimodular, $t^G_a=\\sum_{|I|=a}z_I\\,\\mathrm{qminor}_{I,I}$. States normalized by $\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|\\Psi_A\\rangle=1=\\langle\\Psi_A|\\mathrm{vacR}\\otimes\\mathrm{vacR}\\rangle$ (L = 1 vacua, parameters $p_1,p_2$). Site rep `repT` and point `ptIndexT` are switches in cell 3; cell 11 is the ledger.\n\n**Checked** for $\\lambda=[2,1,0],[3,1,0],[3,2,0]$ at three points (with $h=1,\\tfrac12,\\tfrac34$), all residuals $\\lesssim10^{-77}$. Notation: $\\theta_{12}=\\theta_1-\\theta_2$, $e_s=e^{2\\pi i\\theta_s/h}$, $\\nu^{(s)}_n(u)=u-\\theta_s-h\\lambda_n$ (one site).\n\n1. **Scalar product** (cell 7). $\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_B\\rangle=\\kappa_2\\,\\det N^{AB}/(c^{\\rm ref}_A\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_B)$: $6\\times6$ FSoV det, one contour around all poles $\\theta_s+nh$ ($n=\\lambda_3..\\lambda_1$), rows $(\\alpha,i,j)$ with $e^{2\\pi i(\\alpha-1)u/h}$ and $(i,j)\\in\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$, columns $u^\\beta\\{-Q^jQ_i,\\,Q^jQ_i^{[-2]},\\,Q^{j[2]}Q_i\\}$; $c^{\\rm ref},\\Psi^{\\rm ref}$ = the L = 1 ones of `L1-orthogonality-diagonal-frame.wb` multiplied over sites.\n2. **$\\kappa_2$** (cell 8, exact at rational points; the $z_i^{\\theta_s/h}$ cancel). With $\\kappa_1=\\dfrac{(\\lambda_1!)^3}{(z_2-z_1)^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2}(z_1-z_3)^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_3}(z_2-z_3)^{\\lambda_2-\\lambda_3}}$,\n$$\\kappa_2=(-1)^{\\lambda_1+1}\\,h^{6\\lambda_1}\\,\\kappa_1^2\\,\\frac{\\big[\\prod_{n=-\\lambda_1}^{\\lambda_1}(\\theta_{12}-nh)\\big]^3}{(e_1-e_2)^3}.$$\n   The product form is read off $[2,1,0]$ and holds for the other two reps; sign and $h^{6\\lambda_1}$ are fitted on $\\lambda_1=2,3$ only.\n3. **First factor** (cell 9). $\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle$ with the L = 1 measure on **site 1 only**, $1/\\prod_{k=0}^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2}\\nu^{(1)}_1(u+kh)$, normalized at $\\theta_1+\\lambda_2h$:\n$$\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle=\\langle v_1\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|\\Psi_A\\rangle,\\qquad \\langle v_1|=(1-k_1z_1)^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2}e_1^Te^{p_1'E_{12}}e^{p_2E_{13}}e^{p_3E_{23}},\\ p_1'=p_1\\tfrac{1-k_1z_2}{1-k_1z_1},$$\n   i.e. the L = 1 covector on site 1 and the vacuum on site 2.\n4. **Second factor** (cell 10). Contour only around $\\theta_1,\\dots,\\theta_1+\\lambda_2h$, measure\n$$m(u)=\\frac{1}{\\prod_{k=0}^{\\lambda_2}\\nu^{(1)}_3(u-kh)\\ \\prod_{n=\\lambda_2+1}^{\\lambda_1}(u-\\theta_2-nh)},$$\n   normalized at $\\theta_1$. Then, with the site-1 fused transfer matrices $t^{(1)}_{\\{m,m\\}}(\\theta_1)$ of `L1-mathcalA.wb`,\n$$\\langle k_1^{u/h}Q_1\\rangle\\,\\langle k_2^{u/h}Q_{12}\\rangle_m=\\langle v_1\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|\\sum_{m=0}^{\\lambda_2}(-1)^m\\binom{\\lambda_2}{m}k_2^m\\,t^{(1)}_{\\{m,m\\}}(\\theta_1)\\otimes1\\,|\\Psi_A\\rangle,$$\n   exactly the L = 1 form. The site-2 factor in $m(u)$ is needed: $\\langle v_1\\otimes\\mathrm{vacL}|t^{(1)}_{\\{m,m\\}}\\otimes1|\\Psi_A\\rangle=c_m\\,\\mathcal A_A\\,Q_{12}(\\theta_1+mh)/Q_{12}(\\theta_1)$ with $c_m=\\prod_{n=\\lambda_2+1}^{\\lambda_1}\\frac{\\theta_{12}-nh}{\\theta_{12}+mh-nh}$ (fitted per state, equal to the ratio produced by $m(u)$ at every point). Without it (site-1 measure alone) the relation holds only up to these $c_m$; the full two-site $\\nu_3(u)\\nu_3(u-h)$ does not absorb them.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n    ps[rep] =\n    Block[\n        {res = (Prepend[rep, #]& /@ (Tuples[Table[Range[rep〚1, i + 1〛, rep〚1, i〛], {i, 1, Length[rep〚1〛] - 1}]]))},\n        If[Length[res〚1, 1〛] == 1, Reverse @ Sort @ res, Reverse @ Sort @ Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]\n    ];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat〚k, i〛, {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat〚k - 1, i〛, {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jp[k][pat] =\n    -Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k + 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 + 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJm[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jm[k][pat] =\n    Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k - 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 - 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] :=\n    JJ[k, l, rep] =\n    Which[\n        k == l,\n        DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n        l == k + 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l == k - 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l > k + 1,\n        JJ[k, k + 1, rep].JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n        l < k - 1,\n        JJ[k, k - 1, rep].JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k - 1, rep]\n    ];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. L = 2 chain, both sites in repT, exact rational point. Minors: rows antisymmetrized, k-th column at u-(k-1)h (as QMG in L1-mathcalA).\n   Switches: repT (site rep, default {2,1,0}) and ptIndexT (numeric point, default 1); set them before running the notebook.\n   The coefficient matrices of t^G_a are obtained exactly by evaluating the minors at 2a+1 rational u and interpolating (sparse, no symbolic u). ---- *)\nClearAll[precT, dsT, dcT, idT, ElT, E1T, E2T, EtotT, hT, thT, zT, p1T, p2T, p3T, ptListT, TatT, qminAtT, qcoefT, tcoefT, nuT, qdetT];\nprecT = 100;\nIf[! ListQ[repT], repT = {2, 1, 0}];\nIf[! IntegerQ[ptIndexT], ptIndexT = 1];\ndsT = dim[repT]; dcT = dsT^2; idT = IdentityMatrix[dsT, SparseArray];\nElT[i_, j_] := ElT[i, j] = SparseArray[JJ[i, j, repT]];\n(* site 1 (x) site 2, row-major: index (n1-1) dsT + n2 *)\nE1T[i_, j_] := E1T[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[ElT[i, j], idT];\nE2T[i_, j_] := E2T[i, j] = KroneckerProduct[idT, ElT[i, j]];\nEtotT[i_, j_] := E1T[i, j] + E2T[i, j];\n\n(* numeric points {h, {θ1, θ2}, z, {p1, p2}}, all with unimodular z *)\nptListT = {\n    {1, {1/3, -8/57}, {5/2, 7/3, 6/35}, {3/5, 4/7}},\n    {1/2, {2/7, -3/11}, {3/2, 5/4, 8/15}, {2/3, 5/7}},\n    {3/4, {5/13, 1/9}, {2, 3/7, 7/6}, {3/5, 4/7}}\n};\n{hT, thT, zT, {p1T, p2T}} = ptListT[[ptIndexT]];\np3T = p2T (zT[[3]] - zT[[1]]) / (p1T (zT[[2]] - zT[[3]]));\n\n(* T_ij(x) = sum_k L1_ik(x - θ1) L2_kj(x - θ2) at a rational x *)\nTatT[i_, j_, x_] := Sum[((x - thT[[1]]) KroneckerDelta[i, k] IdentityMatrix[dcT, SparseArray] - hT E1T[k, i]) . ((x - thT[[2]]) KroneckerDelta[k, j] IdentityMatrix[dcT, SparseArray] - hT E2T[j, k]), {k, 3}];\nqminAtT[II_, x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[TatT[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]], x - (k - 1) hT], {k, Length[II]}], {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\n(* qminor_I is a polynomial of degree 2|I| in u: interpolate from 2|I|+1 integer points *)\nDo[\n    With[{xs = Range[1, 2 Length[II] + 1]},\n        With[{vals = qminAtT[II, #] & /@ xs, vinv = Inverse[Outer[Power, xs, Range[0, 2 Length[II]]]]},\n            Do[qcoefT[II, k] = Sum[vinv[[k + 1, m]] vals[[m]], {m, Length[xs]}], {k, 0, 2 Length[II]}]\n        ]\n    ],\n    {II, Join @@ (Subsets[Range[3], {#}] & /@ Range[3])}\n];\ntcoefT[a_, k_] := tcoefT[a, k] = Sum[(Times @@ zT[[II]]) qcoefT[II, k], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n\nnuT[n_][x_] := Product[x - th - hT repT[[n]], {th, thT}];\nqdetT[x_] := nuT[1][x - 2 hT] nuT[2][x - hT] nuT[3][x];\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"site rep, point index, {h, θ, z, p}\", {repT, ptIndexT, ptListT[[ptIndexT]]}},\n        {\"chain dimension\", dcT},\n        {\"twist unimodular\", Times @@ zT == 1},\n        {\"coefficients of t1, t2 commute\", Max[Flatten @ Table[Abs[Normal[tcoefT[a, k] . tcoefT[b, l] - tcoefT[b, l] . tcoefT[a, k]]], {a, 2}, {b, 2}, {k, 0, 2 a}, {l, 0, 2 b}]] == 0},\n        {\"t3 = z1 z2 z3 qdet\", Max[Abs[Normal[Sum[tcoefT[3, k] #^k, {k, 0, 6}] - qdetT[#] IdentityMatrix[dcT]]] & /@ {7/5, -2/3}] == 0}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"400495\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"25\" data-sub-idx=\"23\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"2\" data-sub-start=\"40\" data-sub-end=\"49\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[25]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"27\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.05em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.295em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.01em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.255em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site rep, point index, {h, </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord\">, z, p}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.205em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">chain dimension</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">twist unimodular</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.805em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">coefficients of t1, t2 commute</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.605em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t3 = z1 z2 z3 qdet</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.01em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.255em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">57</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">35</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.205em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.805em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.605em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.01em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[25]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{site rep, point index, \\{h, $\\theta$, z, p\\}} & \\left\\{\\left\\{2,1,0\\right\\},1,\\left\\{1,\\left\\{\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{8}{57}\\right\\},\\left\\{\\frac{5}{2},\\frac{7}{3},\\frac{6}{35}\\right\\},\\left\\{\\frac{3}{5},\\frac{4}{7}\\right\\}\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{chain dimension} & 64\\\\\\hline\\text{twist unimodular} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{coefficients of t1, t2 commute} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{t3 = z1 z2 z3 qdet} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "e49949a3-f958-44e9-a833-b5228cb25a73"
    }
