  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Twisted FSoV determinant vs the physical scalar product\n\nEvery bracket is one contour around **all** poles $\\theta_s+nh$ ($s=1,2$; $n=\\lambda_3,\\dots,\\lambda_1$), weights = residues of $1/\\prod(u-\\text{pole})$; the second copy of the row triple carries $e^{2\\pi i u/h}$ (layout of `SU3_L2_Baxter_Twisted_Final.wb`). Rows $(\\alpha,i,j)$, $\\alpha\\in\\{1,2\\}$, $(i,j)\\in\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$ (the triple of `L1-orthogonality-diagonal-frame.wb`); columns $u^\\beta\\{-Q^j_AQ_{i,B},\\,Q^j_AQ^{[-2]}_{i,B},\\,Q^{j[2]}_AQ_{i,B}\\}$, $\\beta=0,1$.\n\nNormalization = the L = 1 one multiplied over sites:\n$$\n\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_B=\\prod_s Q_1(\\theta_s+\\lambda_2h)\\,Q_{12}(\\theta_s),\\qquad\nc^{\\rm ref}_A=\\prod_s Q^3(\\theta_s+\\lambda_2h)\\big[Q^3(\\theta_s+\\lambda_1h)Q^2(\\theta_s+(\\lambda_1+1)h)-Q^2(\\theta_s+\\lambda_1h)Q^3(\\theta_s+(\\lambda_1+1)h)\\big],\n$$\nand $\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_B\\rangle=\\kappa_2\\,\\det N^{AB}/(c^{\\rm ref}_A\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_B)$ with one constant $\\kappa_2$ fixed by $\\langle\\Omega|\\Omega\\rangle=1$, $\\Omega=e_1\\otimes e_1$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. 6x6 FSoV determinant (full contour, alpha = periodic label) vs <Psi_A|Psi_B> with the product-vacuum normalization.\n   Poles θ_s + n h, n = λ3..λ1 on both sites, weights = residues of 1/prod(u - pole). Each of the 36 entries is a dcT x dcT matrix\n   sum_r W_r a_{A r} b_{B r}, built as one matrix product; then one 6x6 det per pair (A, B). ---- *)\nClearAll[polesT, wPoleT, perT, rowTripleT, rowKeysT, colKeysT, QuX, QuXp, QdX, QdXm, blockT, detMatT, psiRefT, cRefT, kappa2T, sQT, kappa1T];\npolesT = Flatten @ Table[thT[[s]] + n hT, {s, 2}, {n, repT[[3]], repT[[1]]}];\nwPoleT = Table[1 / Times @@ (polesT[[r]] - Delete[polesT, r]), {r, Length[polesT]}];\nperT[alpha_, x_] := Exp[2 Pi I (alpha - 1) SetPrecision[x, precT] / hT];\nrowTripleT = {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}};\nrowKeysT = Flatten[Table[{alpha, ij}, {alpha, 2}, {ij, rowTripleT}], 1];\ncolKeysT = Flatten[Table[{beta, st}, {beta, 0, 1}, {st, 3}], 1];\n\n(* Q values at the poles: rows = states, columns = poles *)\nQuX = Table[QuT[A, j, x], {j, 3}, {A, dcT}, {x, polesT}];\nQuXp = Table[QuT[A, j, x + hT], {j, 3}, {A, dcT}, {x, polesT}];\nQdX = Table[QdT[A, i, x], {i, 3}, {A, dcT}, {x, polesT}];\nQdXm = Table[QdT[A, i, x - hT], {i, 3}, {A, dcT}, {x, polesT}];\n(* columns (beta, st): st = 1,2,3 are -Q^j Q_i, Q^j Q_i^[-2], Q^j[2] Q_i; wt multiplies row r of the transposed pole table *)\nblockT[{alpha_, {i_, j_}}, {beta_, st_}] := With[{wt = Table[wPoleT[[r]] perT[alpha, polesT[[r]]] polesT[[r]]^beta, {r, Length[polesT]}]},\n    Switch[st,\n        1, -(QuX[[j]] . (wt Transpose[QdX[[i]]])),\n        2, QuX[[j]] . (wt Transpose[QdXm[[i]]]),\n        3, QuXp[[j]] . (wt Transpose[QdX[[i]]])\n    ]\n];\ndetMatT = Module[{blocks = Table[blockT[rk, ck], {rk, rowKeysT}, {ck, colKeysT}]},\n    Table[Det[blocks[[All, All, A, B]]], {A, dcT}, {B, dcT}]\n];\n\n(* L = 1 references of L1-orthogonality-diagonal-frame, multiplied over sites: x_ref = (λ2; 0, 0), y_ref = (λ2; λ1, λ1) *)\npsiRefT = Table[Product[QdT[B, 1, th + repT[[2]] hT] (QdT[B, 1, th] QdT[B, 2, th - hT] - QdT[B, 2, th] QdT[B, 1, th - hT]), {th, thT}], {B, dcT}];\ncRefT = Table[Product[QuT[A, 3, th + repT[[2]] hT] (QuT[A, 3, th + repT[[1]] hT] QuT[A, 2, th + (repT[[1]] + 1) hT] - QuT[A, 2, th + repT[[1]] hT] QuT[A, 3, th + (repT[[1]] + 1) hT]), {th, thT}], {A, dcT}];\n\nkappa2T = ovT[[iOmT, iOmT]] cRefT[[iOmT]] psiRefT[[iOmT]] / detMatT[[iOmT, iOmT]];\nsQT = kappa2T detMatT / Outer[Times, cRefT, psiRefT];\n(* L = 1 closed form of L1-orthogonality-diagonal-frame.wb *)\nkappa1T = repT[[1]]!^3 / ((zT[[2]] - zT[[1]])^(repT[[1]] - repT[[2]]) (zT[[1]] - zT[[3]])^(repT[[1]] - repT[[3]]) (zT[[2]] - zT[[3]])^(repT[[2]] - repT[[3]]));\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"# poles\", Length[polesT]},\n        {\"det N: max|offdiag| / min|diag|\", N[Max[Abs[detMatT - DiagonalMatrix[Diagonal[detMatT]]]] / Min[Abs[Diagonal[detMatT]]], 3]},\n        {\"min |c^ref|, min |Psi^ref|\", N[{Min[Abs[cRefT]], Min[Abs[psiRefT]]}, 3]},\n        {\"kappa2\", N[kappa2T, 20]},\n        {\"max |S_Q - <Psi_A|Psi_B>| / max|<Psi_A|Psi_A>|\", N[Max[Abs[sQT - ovT]] / Max[Abs[Diagonal[ovT]]], 3]},\n        {\"max relative diagonal residual\", N[Max[Abs[Diagonal[sQT] / Diagonal[ovT] - 1]], 3]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"557204\" data-output-id=\"377\" data-out-n=\"1409\" data-sub-idx=\"23\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"37\" data-sub-end=\"47\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1409]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.24em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.89em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># poles</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">det N: max|offdiag| / min|diag|</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min |c</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">ref|, min |Psi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">ref|</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kappa2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max |S_Q - &lt;Psi_A|Psi_B&gt;| / max|&lt;Psi_A|Psi_A&gt;|</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max relative diagonal residual</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.17</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">62</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0.252</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0396</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">28.82448921976436731</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">536.22843212821339109</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.03</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">96</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">83</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.35em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
