  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. Second factor <k2^{u/h} Q_12>_m, contour ONLY around the site-1 poles θ1, ..., θ1 + λ2 h, measure\n   m(u) = p(u) / prod_{k=0..λ2} ν3^(1)(u - k h),  ν3^(1)(u) = u - θ1,  p(u) = 1 / prod_{n=λ2+1..λ1} (u - θ2 - n h)  (no poles inside),\n   normalized so that the θ1 term is 1:  F_A = sum_m (-1)^m binom(λ2, m) k2^m rho_m Y_{m,A},  rho_m = p(θ1 + m h)/p(θ1),\n   Y_{m,A} = Q_12(θ1 + m h)/Q_12(θ1),  Q_12(u) = Q_1(u) Q_2(u-h) - Q_2(u) Q_1(u-h) (L = 2 Q's).\n   Operator side: site-1 fused transfer matrices (L1-mathcalA normalization, ν1^(1)(u) = u - θ1 - λ1 h)\n   t11(u) = tG2(u)/(ν1(u) ν1(u-h)),  t22(u) = (tG2(u) tG2(u+h) - tG3(u+h) tG1(u))/(ν1(u) ν1(u-h) ν1(u+h) ν1(u)).\n   (i) fit c_m in <v1 (x) vacL| t_{m,m}(θ1) (x) 1 |Psi_A> = c_m A_A Y_{m,A};  (ii) rho_m = c_m, so\n   A_A F_A = <v1 (x) vacL| sum_m (-1)^m binom(λ2, m) k2^m t_{m,m}(θ1) (x) 1 |Psi_A>, checked directly from the residues of m(u). ---- *)\nClearAll[Q12T, YA2, T1siteT, qmin1siteT, tG1siteT, tmmT, lhsMA2, cMA2, cSpreadA2, kTestA2, nuSiteT, pT, measA2, FA2, finalResA2];\nQ12T[A_, x_] := QdT[A, 1, x] QdT[A, 2, x - hT] - QdT[A, 2, x] QdT[A, 1, x - hT];\nYA2 = Table[Q12T[A, thT[[1]] + m hT] / Q12T[A, thT[[1]]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}, {A, dcT}];\n\n(* site 1 alone, L1-mathcalA conventions: T_ij(x) = (x - θ1) δ_ij - h E_ji, principal minors twisted by z_I *)\nT1siteT[i_, j_][x_] := (x - thT[[1]]) KroneckerDelta[i, j] IdentityMatrix[dsT] - hT Normal[ElT[j, i]];\nqmin1siteT[II_][x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[T1siteT[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]]][x - (k - 1) hT], {k, Length[II]}], {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\ntG1siteT[a_][x_] := Sum[(Times @@ zT[[II]]) qmin1siteT[II][x], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ntmmT[0] = IdentityMatrix[dsT];\ntmmT[1] = With[{x = thT[[1]]}, tG1siteT[2][x] / (nu1site1A2[x] nu1site1A2[x - hT])];\ntmmT[2] = With[{x = thT[[1]]}, (tG1siteT[2][x] . tG1siteT[2][x + hT] - tG1siteT[3][x + hT] . tG1siteT[1][x]) / (nu1site1A2[x] nu1site1A2[x - hT] nu1site1A2[x + hT] nu1site1A2[x])];\n\n(* (i) the per-m constants, fitted over all states and several generic k1 (avoid k1 = 1/z_i) *)\nkTestA2 = {0, 1/7, 3/11, -3};\nlhsMA2 = Table[Expand[vA2 . N[KroneckerProduct[tmmT[m], IdentityMatrix[dsT]], precT] . ketMatT], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}];\n{cMA2, cSpreadA2} = Transpose @ Table[\n    With[{rr = Flatten @ Table[(lhsMA2[[m + 1, A]] / (calA2[[A]] YA2[[m + 1, A]])) /. k1 -> kk, {kk, kTestA2}, {A, dcT}]},\n        {Rationalize[Mean[rr], 10^-60], N[Max[Abs[rr - Mean[rr]]], 3]}\n    ],\n    {m, 0, repT[[2]]}\n];\n\n(* (ii) the measure *)\nnuSiteT[s_, n_][x_] := x - thT[[s]] - hT repT[[n]];\npT[x_] := 1 / Product[x - thT[[2]] - n hT, {n, repT[[2]] + 1, repT[[1]]}];\nmeasA2[x_] := pT[x] / Product[nuSiteT[1, 3][x - k hT], {k, 0, repT[[2]]}];\nFA2 = Module[{x, res = Table[Residue[measA2[x], {x, thT[[1]] + m hT}], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}]},\n    Table[Sum[k2^m res[[m + 1]] / res[[1]] YA2[[m + 1, A]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}], {A, dcT}]\n];\nfinalResA2 = Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[\n    Expand[calA2 FA2 - Sum[(-1)^m Binomial[repT[[2]], m] k2^m lhsMA2[[m + 1]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}]], {k1, k2}]]]];\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"site rep, point\", {repT, ptIndexT}},\n        {\"min |Q_12(θ1)| over states\", N[Min[Abs[Table[Q12T[A, thT[[1]]], {A, dcT}]]], 3]},\n        {\"c_m, m = 0..λ2 (fitted)\", cMA2},\n        {\"spread of c_m over states and k1\", cSpreadA2},\n        {\"rho_m = p(θ1 + m h)/p(θ1)\", Table[pT[thT[[1]] + m hT] / pT[thT[[1]]], {m, 0, repT[[2]]}]},\n        {\"max |A_A F_A - <v1 vacL| sum_m (-1)^m binom k2^m t_mm (x) 1 |Psi_A>|, all orders in k1, k2\", N[finalResA2, 3]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
