   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 8. Results ledger. resultsT is deliberately NOT cleared: set repT / ptIndexT, re-run cells 3-11, and each (rep, point) adds a row. ---- *)\nIf[! AssociationQ[resultsT], resultsT = <||>];\nresultsT[{repT, ptIndexT}] = {\n    dcT,\n    N[Max[Join[statesT[[All, \"eigRes\"]], QsT[[All, \"bRes\"]]]], 3],\n    N[Max[Abs[sQT - ovT]] / Max[Abs[Diagonal[ovT]]], 3],\n    Factor[kappa2At[{zT, thT, hT}] / kappa2Shape[zT, thT, hT]],\n    N[Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[vA2 - candA2, k1]]]], 3],\n    cMA2,\n    Max[cSpreadA2],\n    N[finalResA2, 3]\n};\nGrid[\n    Prepend[KeyValueMap[Join[{Row[#1[[1]], \",\"], #1[[2]]}, #2] &, resultsT],\n        {\"rep\", \"point\", \"dim\", \"eig/Baxter res.\", \"SP: |S_Q - <Psi|Psi>|\", \"kappa2 / shape\", \"|v - v1 (x) vacL|\", \"c_m\", \"c_m spread\", \"final 2nd-factor res.\"}],\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
