  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 9. Same test for all three 2x2 Wronskians Q_ab(u) = Q_a(u) Q_b(u-h) - Q_b(u) Q_a(u-h), (ab, c) = (12,3), (13,2), (23,1).\n   Expectation from the cross product Q(u) x Q(u-h): Q_ab = c_ab F(u) Q^c(u), no shift, with the state-independent\n   F(u) = prod_s prod_{n = λ2+1..λ1} (u - θ_s - n h)  (degree 2(λ1-λ2); = nu1 for the adjoint). Output per pair: max relative remainder\n   over all states, the set of quotients / F (should be one constant), and 1/z_b - 1/z_a for comparison. ---- *)\nClearAll[pabPoly, wronTest, fixF];\nfixF[x_] := Product[x - thT[[s]] - n hT, {s, 2}, {n, repT[[2]] + 1, repT[[1]]}];\npabPoly[A_, a_, b_] := Expand[qpolyT[QsT[[A, \"q\", a]], u] (qpolyT[QsT[[A, \"q\", b]], u - hT] / N[zT[[b]], precT]) - qpolyT[QsT[[A, \"q\", b]], u] (qpolyT[QsT[[A, \"q\", a]], u - hT] / N[zT[[a]], precT])];\nwronTest[{a_, b_, c_}] := Module[{rows = Table[With[{pr = PolynomialQuotientRemainder[pabPoly[A, a, b], Expand[fixF[u] qpolyT[QsT[[A, \"qd\", c]], u]], u]},\n        {Max[Join[{0}, Abs[CoefficientList[pr[[2]], u]]]] / Max[Abs[CoefficientList[pabPoly[A, a, b], u]]], pr[[1]]}], {A, dcT}]},\n    {{a, b, c}, N[Max[rows[[All, 1]]], 3], Union[Round[rows[[All, 2]], 10^-30]], 1 / zT[[b]] - 1 / zT[[a]]}];\nwronRes = wronTest /@ {{1, 2, 3}, {1, 3, 2}, {2, 3, 1}};\nGrid[Prepend[wronRes, {\"(a, b, c)\", \"max rel. remainder\", \"quotient / F (all states)\", \"1/z_b - 1/z_a\"}], Frame -> All]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
