  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 10. Can a k2^2 term with Q at θ1 + 2h be a product overlap <v (x) vacL|Psi_A>?  (λ2 = 1, so the k2^2 term is beyond the existing functional.)\n   Q_12 = c F(u) Q^3(u) with F(θ1 + 2h) = 0 for the adjoint, so Q_12(θ1 + 2h) = 0 identically: the question only has content for Q^3.\n   Test: each k1-coefficient of A_A * ratio_A must lie in the 8-dim span of rows (e_i (x) vacL1) . ketMatT. A k2-term coefficient is an overall\n   scalar, so span membership is the whole question. Rows: sanity (Q12 at θ1+h, known to be in), Q12 at θ1+2h, Q^3 at θ1+2h with two\n   normalizations, and Q^3 at θ1+h (the stripped version of the known term).\n   Last two rows (k1^0 only): the most lenient version, Q^3(θ1+2h)/N with N = Q^3(θ1) or Q^3(θ1+h), allowing ANY admixture of the other two\n   Q^3 values over the same N (span enlarged by those two vectors). ---- *)\nClearAll[prodBasisT, spanResT, ratioTargetsT, spanTableT, q3RatT, lenientT];\nprodBasisT = Table[N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[UnitVector[dsT, i], vacL1T]], precT] . ketMatT, {i, dsT}];\n(* relative least-squares residual of y against the span of the rows of basis *)\nspanResT[y_, basis_ : prodBasisT] := If[Max[Abs[y]] == 0, 0, With[{c = LeastSquares[Transpose[basis], y]}, Max[Abs[c . basis - y]] / Max[Abs[y]]]];\nratioTargetsT = {\n    {\"Q12(θ1+h)/Q12(θ1)  [known: in span]\", Table[Q12T[A, thT[[1]] + hT] / Q12T[A, thT[[1]]], {A, dcT}]},\n    {\"Q12(θ1+2h)/Q12(θ1)\", Table[Q12T[A, thT[[1]] + 2 hT] / Q12T[A, thT[[1]]], {A, dcT}]},\n    {\"Q^3(θ1+h)/Q^3(θ1)\", Table[QuT[A, 3, thT[[1]] + hT] / QuT[A, 3, thT[[1]]], {A, dcT}]},\n    {\"Q^3(θ1+2h)/Q^3(θ1)\", Table[QuT[A, 3, thT[[1]] + 2 hT] / QuT[A, 3, thT[[1]]], {A, dcT}]},\n    {\"Q^3(θ1+2h)/Q^3(θ1+h)\", Table[QuT[A, 3, thT[[1]] + 2 hT] / QuT[A, 3, thT[[1]] + hT], {A, dcT}]}\n};\n(* rows of kOrders = k1-orders, each a 64-vector over states *)\nspanTableT = Table[\n    With[{kOrders = Transpose[PadRight[CoefficientList[Expand[calA2 tg[[2]]], k1]]]},\n        {tg[[1]], N[Max[Abs[tg[[2]]]], 3], N[spanResT /@ kOrders, 3]}\n    ],\n    {tg, ratioTargetsT}\n];\nq3RatT[n_, d_] := Table[QuT[A, 3, thT[[1]] + n hT] / QuT[A, 3, thT[[1]] + d hT], {A, dcT}];\nlenientT = {\n    {\"Q^3(θ1+2h)/Q^3(θ1) + a Q^3(θ1+h)/Q^3(θ1) + b\", {\"-\", N[spanResT[q3RatT[2, 0], Join[prodBasisT, {q3RatT[1, 0], q3RatT[0, 0]}]], 3]}},\n    {\"Q^3(θ1+2h)/Q^3(θ1+h) + a Q^3(θ1)/Q^3(θ1+h) + b\", {\"-\", N[spanResT[q3RatT[2, 1], Join[prodBasisT, {q3RatT[0, 1], q3RatT[1, 1]}]], 3]}}\n};\nGrid[Prepend[Join[spanTableT, {#[[1]], \"-\", #[[2, 2]]} & /@ lenientT], {\"target  (times A_A = <k1 Q1>)\", \"max |ratio|\", \"span residual per k1-order\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
